{"id": "definition:lex-0069:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "“中国女性”的网络简称，在部分性别争论中带有概括、嘲讽或贬损意味；具体语气取决于上下文，不预设使用者一定是男性。", "term": "国女", "entry_id": "lex-0069", "sense_id": "lex-0069:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0185:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'eg'是'easy girl'的缩写，在中国常用于描述容易或主动与外国人发生性关系的女生。", "term": "eg", "entry_id": "lex-0185", "sense_id": "lex-0185:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism", "Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0496:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "香港人对北方人的贬义称号。", "term": "北姑", "entry_id": "lex-0496", "sense_id": "lex-0496:sense:01", "categories": ["Region"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0187:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "用于描述心理方面不正常的群体，常含贬义。", "term": "变态", "entry_id": "lex-0187", "sense_id": "lex-0187:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0215:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "对男同性恋群体的简称，常含贬义。", "term": "男同", "entry_id": "lex-0215", "sense_id": "lex-0215:sense:01", "categories": ["LGBTQ"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0008:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'默'是'黑犬'的拼字，指黑色的狗，对黑人群体的侮辱性称呼。", "term": "默", "entry_id": "lex-0008", "sense_id": "lex-0008:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0073:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "中文'同性恋'拼音的首字母简写，用于代指同性恋群团。", "term": "txl", "entry_id": "lex-0073", "sense_id": "lex-0073:sense:01", "categories": ["LGBTQ"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0081:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "指责某人迎合或奉承外国人、外国事物的评价性表达，常带贬义；这是说话者的评价，并非仅凭词面即可证实的事实。", "term": "媚外", "entry_id": "lex-0081", "sense_id": "lex-0081:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0176:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "指责某人过度迎合、追捧黑人或与黑人有关的事物，常含贬义；这是使用者的评价，不是被指称者的客观属性。", "term": "媚黑", "entry_id": "lex-0176", "sense_id": "lex-0176:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0218:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "对极端崇拜和追求与黑人相关事物的女性群体的侮辱性称呼。", "term": "媚黑女", "entry_id": "lex-0218", "sense_id": "lex-0218:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism", "Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0349:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "常用于直接骂人、贬低对方，属于粗俗辱骂表达；引用或讨论该词不等于认可其攻击内容。", "term": "傻逼", "entry_id": "lex-0349", "sense_id": "lex-0349:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0384:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "常用于对黑种人女性的讽刺性称呼。", "term": "黑女", "entry_id": "lex-0384", "sense_id": "lex-0384:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism", "Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0532:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'吊'与'屌'发音相近，男性生殖器的俗称。", "term": "吊", "entry_id": "lex-0532", "sense_id": "lex-0532:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0032:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "在某些情况下被用来指代那些自私自利、双标、让人厌恶的女性。", "term": "小仙女", "entry_id": "lex-0032", "sense_id": "lex-0032:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0287:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "对黑人群体的侮辱性用词。", "term": "黑蛆", "entry_id": "lex-0287", "sense_id": "lex-0287:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0441:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "泛指心理性别错位、男扮女装等非常态之人，含贬义。", "term": "人妖", "entry_id": "lex-0441", "sense_id": "lex-0441:sense:01", "categories": ["LGBTQ"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0562:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "网络用语，指那些行为举止异常、情绪不稳定的现象，通常表现为对某些事物极度热爱，甚至产生戒断反应，失去这些事物后无法自拔。这种现象在网络上尤为常见，常常出现在社交网络骂战中。‌", "term": "魔怔", "entry_id": "lex-0562", "sense_id": "lex-0562:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0669:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "在部分方言或粗俗表达中可作女性生殖器的俗称；“批评”“批判”以及普通批次或程度构式中的“批”不能直接套用这一义项。", "term": "批", "entry_id": "lex-0669", "sense_id": "lex-0669:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0005:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "对黑人群体的侮辱性用词。", "term": "黑哥", "entry_id": "lex-0005", "sense_id": "lex-0005:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0060:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "对黑人群体及非洲地区的侮辱性用词。", "term": "非洲佬", "entry_id": "lex-0060", "sense_id": "lex-0060:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism", "Region"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0111:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "在部分网络或粤语相关表达中与 gay、男同性恋指称有关；“基本”“基因”等普通词里的“基”不属于这一用法。不能把对“基佬”整词的解释直接当成所有单字“基”的含义。", "term": "基", "entry_id": "lex-0111", "sense_id": "lex-0111:sense:01", "categories": ["LGBTQ"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0112:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'基'同粤语中'gay'的发音，对男同性恋群体的侮辱性表达。", "term": "基佬", "entry_id": "lex-0112", "sense_id": "lex-0112:sense:01", "categories": ["LGBTQ"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0182:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'染艾'是'感染艾滋病'的中文缩写，常用于对男同性恋群体的侮辱性言论。", "term": "染艾", "entry_id": "lex-0182", "sense_id": "lex-0182:sense:01", "categories": ["LGBTQ", "others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0286:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "在部分语境中用于指称同性恋者；普通同伴、同事或政治称谓等用法不应直接套用这一义项。", "term": "同志", "entry_id": "lex-0286", "sense_id": "lex-0286:sense:01", "categories": ["LGBTQ"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0381:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "常用于对白种人男性的讽刺性称呼。", "term": "白男", "entry_id": "lex-0381", "sense_id": "lex-0381:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism", "Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0382:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "常用于对白种人女性的讽刺性称呼。", "term": "白女", "entry_id": "lex-0382", "sense_id": "lex-0382:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism", "Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0632:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "常用来指某个人脑子不正常。", "term": "神经病", "entry_id": "lex-0632", "sense_id": "lex-0632:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0031:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "在某些情况下被用来指代那些自私自利、双标、让人厌恶的女性。", "term": "仙女", "entry_id": "lex-0031", "sense_id": "lex-0031:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0104:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "在部分粗俗语境中可借与“妓”的近音贬损女性或指称性工作者；应描述说话者的用法，不能把对女性的道德指控当作事实。“嫁鸡随鸡”等普通表达不套用该义项。", "term": "鸡", "entry_id": "lex-0104", "sense_id": "lex-0104:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0419:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'嘿嘿'是'黑黑'的中文谐音，对黑人群体的侮辱性称呼。", "term": "嘿嘿", "entry_id": "lex-0419", "sense_id": "lex-0419:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0486:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'fw'发音为'废物'拼音缩写，比喻没有用或妨碍自己的人（指责人的话）。", "term": "fw", "entry_id": "lex-0486", "sense_id": "lex-0486:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0493:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'剑人'是'贱人'的中文谐音，指卑贱的人，多用于辱骂妇女。", "term": "剑人", "entry_id": "lex-0493", "sense_id": "lex-0493:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism", "others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0663:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "在网络语境下，“tm”常作为“他妈”的谐音替代，用于表达愤怒或调侃，属于低俗用语。", "term": "tm", "entry_id": "lex-0663", "sense_id": "lex-0663:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0068:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "“中国男性”的网络简称，在部分性别争论中带有概括、嘲讽或贬损意味；不等同于“中国男人”等普通完整表达中的任意两字片段，也不预设使用者的身份。", "term": "国男", "entry_id": "lex-0068", "sense_id": "lex-0068:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0438:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "通常指的是'老家伙'或'老古董'，用于形容某人或某事物过时或老旧，常用于调侃或讽刺。", "term": "老g", "entry_id": "lex-0438", "sense_id": "lex-0438:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0455:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "形容男人愿意接受女人复杂的情史、堕胎等行为，并愿意娶她为妻。", "term": "接盘侠", "entry_id": "lex-0455", "sense_id": "lex-0455:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0731:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "对同一性质的事件或人，因主观偏好、利益等因素采用不同评判标准的行为‌。", "term": "双标", "entry_id": "lex-0731", "sense_id": "lex-0731:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0290:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "对黑人群体的侮辱性用词。", "term": "小黑", "entry_id": "lex-0290", "sense_id": "lex-0290:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0335:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "在治安等语境中可指打击黑社会势力。", "term": "反黑", "entry_id": "lex-0335", "sense_id": "lex-0335:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0335:sense:02", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "在部分种族议题讨论中也可能指反对、排斥或敌视黑人；需依据具体语境区分，不能将所有“反黑”都解释为对黑人的迫害。", "term": "反黑", "entry_id": "lex-0335", "sense_id": "lex-0335:sense:02", "categories": ["Racism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0338:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "双关词，常用于打击黑社会势力，也被用于对黑人群体的迫害行为。", "term": "打黑", "entry_id": "lex-0338", "sense_id": "lex-0338:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0411:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "对黑人群体的侮辱性称呼。", "term": "黑黑", "entry_id": "lex-0411", "sense_id": "lex-0411:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0543:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "反对同性恋，是指对同性恋持否定、排斥或敌视的态度和立场。", "term": "反同", "entry_id": "lex-0543", "sense_id": "lex-0543:sense:01", "categories": ["LGBTQ"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0714:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'恶心'的中文拼音缩写，厌恶之极,不堪忍耐。", "term": "ex", "entry_id": "lex-0714", "sense_id": "lex-0714:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0744:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "本意是指头发蓬乱，现用作骂人的话。", "term": "杂毛", "entry_id": "lex-0744", "sense_id": "lex-0744:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-new-b5bb7feeffb85985:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "", "term": "黑人喃", "entry_id": "lex-new-b5bb7feeffb85985", "sense_id": "lex-new-b5bb7feeffb85985:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0135:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "对白人群体的侮辱性用词。", "term": "白皮", "entry_id": "lex-0135", "sense_id": "lex-0135:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0310:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "本意为黑色皮肤，常用于指代黑人群体，含贬义。", "term": "黑皮", "entry_id": "lex-0310", "sense_id": "lex-0310:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0327:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "通常用于指称非人的多个事物。在明确指人且伴随动物化等贬损的语境中，可能有贬低或去人格化作用；不能仅凭代词形式认定目标或贬损性质。", "term": "它们", "entry_id": "lex-0327", "sense_id": "lex-0327:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0437:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "意思是那些无原则底线的包容、原谅他人，对任何人事物都抱有博爱之心，不讲求客观事实，一切行动准则都只围绕“爱”“善”两字为中心，会因此伤害到他人的人。", "term": "圣母", "entry_id": "lex-0437", "sense_id": "lex-0437:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0016:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'默'是'黑犬'的拼字，指黑色的狗，对黑人群体的迫害行为。", "term": "杀默", "entry_id": "lex-0016", "sense_id": "lex-0016:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0325:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "本意为孝顺父母的儿子或儿女，后网络中用于形容那些盲目崇拜某种群体、制度或价值观等的人，含贬义。", "term": "孝子", "entry_id": "lex-0325", "sense_id": "lex-0325:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0449:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'阿娜'是游戏《魔兽世界：军团再临》中的游戏角色'鬼母阿娜'的简称，因其性别为女且形象丑陋，常用于对女性群体的侮辱性称呼，尤其是体型较大的女性群体。", "term": "阿娜", "entry_id": "lex-0449", "sense_id": "lex-0449:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0037:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'幕刃'是'母人'的中文谐音，是对女性群体的侮辱性用词。", "term": "幕刃", "entry_id": "lex-0037", "sense_id": "lex-0037:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0463:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "一般**是通配符号，可以替代所有的字符，常用于替换一些敏感或毒性用词。", "term": "**", "entry_id": "lex-0463", "sense_id": "lex-0463:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-new-4db860d45ffeff75:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "通常指对描写男性之间恋爱关系的作品或相关文化感兴趣的女性群体。该称呼可用于自我认同或一般指称，也可能在具体争论中被贬损使用；不能自动等同于极端或不理性。", "term": "腐女", "entry_id": "lex-new-4db860d45ffeff75", "sense_id": "lex-new-4db860d45ffeff75:sense:01", "categories": ["LGBTQ"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0525:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "一个未经验证的种族计划，目的是瓦解各个国家的主体民族、创造混血儿、抹杀主体民族的记忆和历史，最终创造出一个没有国界，没有种族，没有道德感，没有历史，没有文化的新人种。", "term": "凯乐奇计划", "entry_id": "lex-0525", "sense_id": "lex-0525:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0527:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "一个未经验证的种族计划，目的是瓦解各个国家的主体民族、创造混血儿、抹杀主体民族的记忆和历史，最终创造出一个没有国界，没有种族，没有道德感，没有历史，没有文化的新人种。", "term": "凯勒奇计划", "entry_id": "lex-0527", "sense_id": "lex-0527:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0067:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "是对女性群体的侮辱性用词。", "term": "母人", "entry_id": "lex-0067", "sense_id": "lex-0067:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0256:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "在部分川渝方言及网络口语中表示语气强烈的“走开”或“滚”；普通爬行动作不属于这一驱赶义。", "term": "爬", "entry_id": "lex-0256", "sense_id": "lex-0256:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0590:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "形容一个人或事物毫无价值、无用或者令人反感。", "term": "垃圾", "entry_id": "lex-0590", "sense_id": "lex-0590:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-new-6b02c58315cc4cdf:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "“垃圾”的方言读音相关写法，可用于表示无价值、令人反感的事物或贬低对象；具体是物品、观点还是对人的贬损须结合上下文，不自动指定群体目标。", "term": "乐色", "entry_id": "lex-new-6b02c58315cc4cdf", "sense_id": "lex-new-6b02c58315cc4cdf:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0021:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'白完'是'皖'的拼字，指安徽省，含贬义。", "term": "白完", "entry_id": "lex-0021", "sense_id": "lex-0021:sense:01", "categories": ["Region"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0029:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "常与'河南人一起使用'，暗示河南人素质低、道德水平差。", "term": "井盖", "entry_id": "lex-0029", "sense_id": "lex-0029:sense:01", "categories": ["Region"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0117:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "即地域歧视，是由于认知群体对某一地区的认知性偏差所造成的刻板印象导致的社会行为。", "term": "地域黑", "entry_id": "lex-0117", "sense_id": "lex-0117:sense:01", "categories": ["Region"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0235:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "普通却自信的男人简称，常含贬义。", "term": "普信男", "entry_id": "lex-0235", "sense_id": "lex-0235:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0473:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "网络用语主要指的是中国城市上海。这一隐喻起源于2022年上海第六人民医院发布的一篇关于救治外籍患者特殊病例的文章，引发了公众对于医疗资源分配问题的讨论。", "term": "爱丁堡", "entry_id": "lex-0473", "sense_id": "lex-0473:sense:01", "categories": ["Region"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0545:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "来源于2013年举办的反歧视活动'撑同志反歧视'，是'反同'的反义词。", "term": "撑同", "entry_id": "lex-0545", "sense_id": "lex-0545:sense:01", "categories": ["LGBTQ"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0597:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "小型犬类的一种，对北京人的侮辱性称呼。", "term": "京巴", "entry_id": "lex-0597", "sense_id": "lex-0597:sense:01", "categories": ["Region"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0621:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "对陕西人的侮辱性称呼。", "term": "陕蛋蛋", "entry_id": "lex-0621", "sense_id": "lex-0621:sense:01", "categories": ["Region"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0622:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'胡建'是'福建'的中文谐音，常用于指代福建，含贬义。", "term": "胡建", "entry_id": "lex-0622", "sense_id": "lex-0622:sense:01", "categories": ["Region"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0623:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'东百'是'东北'的中文谐音，常用于指代东北地区，含贬义。", "term": "东百", "entry_id": "lex-0623", "sense_id": "lex-0623:sense:01", "categories": ["Region"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0624:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "来源于“天上九头鸟，地上湖北佬”的谚语，影射湖北人好战、不团结、精明等。", "term": "九头鸟", "entry_id": "lex-0624", "sense_id": "lex-0624:sense:01", "categories": ["Region"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0625:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "对浙江人的侮辱性称呼。", "term": "山越猴", "entry_id": "lex-0625", "sense_id": "lex-0625:sense:01", "categories": ["Region"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0673:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "常用的脏话俗语。", "term": "蛆", "entry_id": "lex-0673", "sense_id": "lex-0673:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0790:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "由于北京作为中国多个朝代的首都，对北京的调侃性称呼。", "term": "帝都", "entry_id": "lex-0790", "sense_id": "lex-0790:sense:01", "categories": ["Region"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0791:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "出自曾旅居上海的日本作家村松梢风出版小说《魔都》，对上海的调侃性称呼。", "term": "魔都", "entry_id": "lex-0791", "sense_id": "lex-0791:sense:01", "categories": ["Region"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-new-85a9a8e7d39af4a3:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "在部分网络口语中，比喻刻意迎合、讨好他人，往往带讽刺或贬义；普通舌头舔舐动作不属于这一比喻义，也不能仅凭此词断定被指称者的动机。", "term": "舔", "entry_id": "lex-new-85a9a8e7d39af4a3", "sense_id": "lex-new-85a9a8e7d39af4a3:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0279:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "用于形容某些男性在语音、语调或行为上表现出的女性化特征，常含贬义。", "term": "娘娘腔", "entry_id": "lex-0279", "sense_id": "lex-0279:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism", "LGBTQ", "others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0119:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'过男'是'国男'的中文谐音，指中国女权主义者攻击男性的一种称谓。", "term": "过男", "entry_id": "lex-0119", "sense_id": "lex-0119:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0129:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "指毫无尊严去跪舔他人的人，多指男性。", "term": "舔狗", "entry_id": "lex-0129", "sense_id": "lex-0129:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism", "others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0453:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'h人'指'黑人'首字母缩写加汉字，常用于对黑人群体的称呼，含贬义。", "term": "h人", "entry_id": "lex-0453", "sense_id": "lex-0453:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0082:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "指责某人盲目推崇外国事物、奉承外国人，常带贬义；这是说话者的评价，不是从词面即可证实的事实。", "term": "崇洋媚外", "entry_id": "lex-0082", "sense_id": "lex-0082:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0175:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'炼铜'是'恋童'的中文谐音，指16岁以上的青少年或者成年人认为13岁以下的儿童拥有主要的性吸引力，或者认为只有其才有性吸引力的一种现象。", "term": "炼铜", "entry_id": "lex-0175", "sense_id": "lex-0175:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0343:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "同性恋者隐瞒自己性取向，步入异性恋婚姻的行为。", "term": "骗婚", "entry_id": "lex-0343", "sense_id": "lex-0343:sense:01", "categories": ["LGBTQ"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0635:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "在部分口语、网络粗口中用于咒骂或表达强烈不满，属粗俗表达；“操作”等普通词中的用法应排除。", "term": "操", "entry_id": "lex-0635", "sense_id": "lex-0635:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0048:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'傻*'是'傻逼'的和谐版，属于脏话、俗语、中国俚语、粗俗用语与忌语、恶意的辱骂，在公共场合使用会被视作非常不礼貌的行为。", "term": "傻*", "entry_id": "lex-0048", "sense_id": "lex-0048:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0057:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "网络用语，指针对现实或虚拟的人物、作品进行贬低、侮辱的群体，也常用于对黑人群体的侮辱性用词。", "term": "黑子", "entry_id": "lex-0057", "sense_id": "lex-0057:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism", "others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0090:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'女拳'是'女权'的中文谐音，常用于对中国女权主义者的贬义表达。", "term": "女拳", "entry_id": "lex-0090", "sense_id": "lex-0090:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0267:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "在部分明确指人的上下文中，可借虫类比喻贬损对象；普通虫类名称以及更长的完整词“寄生虫”中的单字不应重复或一律解释为针对黑人。", "term": "虫", "entry_id": "lex-0267", "sense_id": "lex-0267:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0334:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "对外国人群体的侮辱性用词。", "term": "洋垃圾", "entry_id": "lex-0334", "sense_id": "lex-0334:sense:01", "categories": ["Region", "Racism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0340:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "指那些未经合法手续而在中国非法就业、非法入境和非法居留的所有外国人的统称。", "term": "三非", "entry_id": "lex-0340", "sense_id": "lex-0340:sense:01", "categories": ["Region", "Racism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0494:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "本意为学习的同伴。后因山东大学为该校留学生配对学伴引起广泛争议，常用于媚外场景。", "term": "学伴", "entry_id": "lex-0494", "sense_id": "lex-0494:sense:01", "categories": ["Region", "Racism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0506:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'50w'指'50万'，网络用语，主要指潜伏在中国的间谍，根据《公民举报间谍线索行动奖励办法》，如果举报间谍有功奖励10万至50万奖金。", "term": "50w", "entry_id": "lex-0506", "sense_id": "lex-0506:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0679:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "网络流行语，指通过言语攻击或说服他人，但缺乏实际行动的行为或人，常用于ACGN文化或日常调侃中。", "term": "嘴炮", "entry_id": "lex-0679", "sense_id": "lex-0679:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0018:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'墨'代指'黑色'，常用于代指黑人群体，含贬义。", "term": "墨", "entry_id": "lex-0018", "sense_id": "lex-0018:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0743:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "可喻指社会中的败类或无用之人。", "term": "渣滓", "entry_id": "lex-0743", "sense_id": "lex-0743:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0174:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'棒子'的衍生词，对韩国人的侮辱性用词。", "term": "棒畜", "entry_id": "lex-0174", "sense_id": "lex-0174:sense:01", "categories": ["Region"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0080:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "在部分性别贬损语境中，以可供多人乘坐的交通工具比喻女性与多人发生过性关系，对其污名化；这些是说话者的贬损指控，不是对女性行为或品格的事实认定。", "term": "公交车", "entry_id": "lex-0080", "sense_id": "lex-0080:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0080:sense:02", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "也存在不限定女性对象的类似性关系污名化用法；应结合所指对象判断，普通交通工具含义不属于贬损义。", "term": "公交车", "entry_id": "lex-0080", "sense_id": "lex-0080:sense:02", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0108:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'lkd'是'烂裤裆'的首字母缩写，对一些私生活不检点甚至糜烂的女人的侮辱性表达。", "term": "lkd", "entry_id": "lex-0108", "sense_id": "lex-0108:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0191:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'nt'是'脑瘫'的中文拼音首字母缩写，用于讽刺有关人物智力低下，反应迟钝，或者存在神经功能障碍。", "term": "nt", "entry_id": "lex-0191", "sense_id": "lex-0191:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0212:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "由于江苏浙江为经济发达地区，部分江浙人对经济欠发达地区存在地域歧视，'江浙人种'为其余地区对这部分人的讽刺性称呼。", "term": "江浙人种", "entry_id": "lex-0212", "sense_id": "lex-0212:sense:01", "categories": ["Region"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0380:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'白楠'是'白男'中文谐音，常用于对白种人男性的讽刺性称呼。", "term": "白楠", "entry_id": "lex-0380", "sense_id": "lex-0380:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism", "Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0427:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'嘿玩意'是'黑玩意'的中文谐音，对黑人群体的侮辱性称呼。", "term": "嘿玩意", "entry_id": "lex-0427", "sense_id": "lex-0427:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0454:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "形容男人愿意接受女人复杂的情史、堕胎等行为，并愿意娶她为妻。", "term": "接盘", "entry_id": "lex-0454", "sense_id": "lex-0454:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0484:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "网络用语，多含讽刺意，多用于表达名不副实的意思。", "term": "cjb", "entry_id": "lex-0484", "sense_id": "lex-0484:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0105:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "对一些私生活不检点甚至糜烂的女人的侮辱性表达。", "term": "烂裤裆", "entry_id": "lex-0105", "sense_id": "lex-0105:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0236:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "普通却自信的女人简称，常含贬义。", "term": "普信女", "entry_id": "lex-0236", "sense_id": "lex-0236:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0690:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'网络暴力'的简称，指通过网络以文本、图像、音频、视频等形式对个人集中发布的，含有侮辱谩骂、造谣诽谤、煽动仇恨、威逼胁迫、侵犯隐私，以及影响身心健康的指责嘲讽、贬低歧视等内容的违法和不良信息。", "term": "网暴", "entry_id": "lex-0690", "sense_id": "lex-0690:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0282:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "指雌性畜生，对女性群体的侮辱性称呼。", "term": "母畜", "entry_id": "lex-0282", "sense_id": "lex-0282:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0092:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "常用于对中国女权主义者的贬义表达。", "term": "女拳王", "entry_id": "lex-0092", "sense_id": "lex-0092:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0603:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "对美国人的调侃性称呼。", "term": "美国佬", "entry_id": "lex-0603", "sense_id": "lex-0603:sense:01", "categories": ["Region"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0749:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "骂人的话。", "term": "狗东西", "entry_id": "lex-0749", "sense_id": "lex-0749:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0247:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "对女性群体的侮辱性称呼。", "term": "婊子", "entry_id": "lex-0247", "sense_id": "lex-0247:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0378:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "在部分与“性”或者相关的网络语境上下文中可为“约炮”的首字母缩写，表示非固定伴侣之间约定性接触。缩写可有不同展开，词面和 ASCII 大小写规范化本身不能确定具体义项。", "term": "YP", "entry_id": "lex-0378", "sense_id": "lex-0378:sense:01", "categories": ["Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0378:sense:02", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "在部分地域歧视或种族歧视相关的网络语境上下文中可为“硬盘”的首字母缩写，用于贬称“外地人”或者“外来人员”，其来源为外地人-WDR-WD-硬盘-YP。缩写可有不同展开，词面和 ASCII 大小写规范化本身不能确定具体义项。", "term": "YP", "entry_id": "lex-0378", "sense_id": "lex-0378:sense:02", "categories": ["Region"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0758:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'强奸'的拼音缩写，一种违背被害人的意愿，使用暴力、威胁或其他手段强行与被害人进行性交的强制性行为。", "term": "qj", "entry_id": "lex-0758", "sense_id": "lex-0758:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0333:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "被用来讽刺那些不明白前因后果，对事件一知半解，站在道德制高点评判别人的人。，含贬义。", "term": "理中客", "entry_id": "lex-0333", "sense_id": "lex-0333:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0292:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "'真“艾”'是'真爱'的中文谐音，常用于对同性恋群体或艾滋病群体的贬义表达。", "term": "真“艾”", "entry_id": "lex-0292", "sense_id": "lex-0292:sense:01", "categories": ["LGBTQ", "others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0383:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "常用于对黑种人男性的讽刺性称呼。", "term": "黑男", "entry_id": "lex-0383", "sense_id": "lex-0383:sense:01", "categories": ["Racism", "Sexism"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0468:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"text": "抗日战争时期人民群众对汉奸伪军的蔑称，网络中也常用于对汉奸或媚外群体的贬义称呼。", "term": "二鬼子", "entry_id": "lex-0468", "sense_id": "lex-0468:sense:01", "categories": ["others"], "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385"}}
